00:32:24,260 --> 00:32:24,560
few.

594
00:32:24,560 --> 00:32:27,580
But the critique goes deeper than just financial loss.

595
00:32:28,720 --> 00:32:33,880
If we are talking about the work functional, we have to look at the physical reality underpinning

596
00:32:33,880 --> 00:32:35,120
the digital illusion.

597
00:32:35,760 --> 00:32:36,800
The material ledger.

598
00:32:36,960 --> 00:32:38,720
The costs that are externalized.

599
00:32:38,800 --> 00:32:41,540
Because a digital ledger is never actually immaterial.

600
00:32:42,180 --> 00:32:48,840
A token transfer feels weightless to us, but it is anchored to a massive, sprawling physical

