00:37:57,780 --> 00:38:02,420
How do we prevent the AI from optimizing us into oblivion based on false premises?

692
00:38:02,880 --> 00:38:07,960
Flyxion proposes a fundamental redesign of AI architecture, centered around something called

693
00:38:07,960 --> 00:38:09,220
the CLIO model.

694
00:38:09,580 --> 00:38:12,340
This is essentially a mathematical formula for restraint.

695
00:38:12,340 --> 00:38:13,700
Let's walk through the variables.

696
00:38:14,280 --> 00:38:16,280
It is H to D to A to W to C.

697
00:38:16,540 --> 00:38:21,780
History to diagnosis to admissible continuations to repair warrant to commitment.

698
00:38:22,180 --> 00:38:24,920
On the surface, it looks like a standard automated pipeline.

699
00:38:25,160 --> 00:38:30,420
But Flyxion's entire thesis is that the arrows connecting those letters must not be automatic.

700
00:38:30,900 --> 00:38:36,380
The purpose of the CLIO architecture is to fiercely protect the semantic gaps between those

701
00:38:36,380 --> 00:38:37,420
operational states.

702
00:38:37,420 --> 00:38:40,680
Flyxion establishes a cardinal rule for artificial intelligence.

703
00:38:41,260 --> 00:38:42,760
Verification is not commitment.

704
00:38:42,960 --> 00:38:43,740
