00:39:02,040 --> 00:39:03,280
The anomaly is real.

711
00:39:03,400 --> 00:39:04,480
The sensors confirm it.

712
00:39:05,020 --> 00:39:06,740
The AI achieves verification.

713
00:39:07,500 --> 00:39:09,960
It has successfully formed a diagnosis, the D.

714
00:39:10,620 --> 00:39:15,560
But Flyxion says that verification absolutely does not grant the AI the authority to immediately

715
00:39:15,560 --> 00:39:16,600
execute a repair.

716
00:39:16,780 --> 00:39:17,120
Correct.

717
00:39:17,560 --> 00:39:20,360
Detecting a failure is an epistemological act.

