00:40:30,480 --> 00:40:31,480
Let me test a metaphor here.

741
00:40:31,560 --> 00:40:31,800
Please.

742
00:40:31,800 --> 00:40:38,660
Imagine you are flying a complex commercial airliner, and you have an incredibly advanced, hyper-intelligent

743
00:40:38,660 --> 00:40:39,820
AI co-pilot.

744
00:40:40,360 --> 00:40:43,380
The AI is monitoring thousands of engine sensors.

745
00:40:43,800 --> 00:40:46,780
It notices a microscopic vibration in the left turbine.

746
00:40:46,860 --> 00:40:48,780
It successfully diagnoses an anomaly.

747
00:40:48,960 --> 00:40:49,220
Yes.

748
00:40:49,600 --> 00:40:55,020
It writes down the exact frequency of the vibration meticulously in the flight log, but it explicitly

749
00:40:55,020 --> 00:40:59,460
refuses to unilaterally cut power to that engine and yank the steering yoke out of your

