00:41:34,740 --> 00:41:40,660
A successful null intervention proves that the AI mathematically understands its own epistemic

763
00:41:40,660 --> 00:41:41,200
boundaries.

764
00:41:41,380 --> 00:41:43,640
Which is the exact opposite of the AI in philosophy.

765
00:41:43,920 --> 00:41:44,060
Yeah.

766
00:41:44,160 --> 00:41:48,940
The AI in architects wanted their smart contracts to automatically mint to token the millisecond

