834
00:45:28,580 --> 00:45:30,040
It is not a warrant for truth.

835
00:45:30,280 --> 00:45:30,720
Precisely.

836
00:45:30,980 --> 00:45:34,440
Just because the pattern of behavior is recent does not mean it should override a fundamental

837
00:45:34,440 --> 00:45:35,580
long-standing constraint.

838
00:45:36,120 --> 00:45:39,940
If I usually drive the speed limit, but yesterday I sted to the hospital for an emergency.

839
00:45:40,360 --> 00:45:46,140
An AI utilizing recency bias might assume your new optimal state is speeding and adjusts your

840
00:45:46,140 --> 00:45:47,820
autonomous vehicle settings accordingly.

841
00:45:48,240 --> 00:45:50,280
It mistakes an anomaly for a new rule.

842
00:45:50,280 --> 00:45:55,720
The AI's verification of the recent event is flawless, but its commitment based on that

843
00:45:55,720 --> 00:45:56,860
event is catastrophic.

844
00:45:57,400 --> 00:46:01,520
I feel like we've systematically dismantled the floorboards beneath the entire digital

845
00:46:01,520 --> 00:46:01,880
age.

