00:46:55,080 --> 00:46:59,620
It fuses two entirely distinct concepts into one legal framework.

860
00:47:00,160 --> 00:47:02,380
It fuses control with truth.

861
00:47:02,600 --> 00:47:03,540
Let's separate those.

