00:47:10,500 --> 00:47:11,000
Exactly.

865
00:47:11,300 --> 00:47:16,180
Truth, on the other hand, is the historical reality of who actually created the work in the

866
00:47:16,180 --> 00:47:16,760
first place.

867
00:47:17,120 --> 00:47:21,940
Modern copyright assumes that to protect the truth of authorship, you must enforce total

868
00:47:21,940 --> 00:47:24,340
control over the distribution of the artifact.

869
00:47:24,540 --> 00:47:26,920
And Flyxion's severs that connection completely.

870
00:47:27,060 --> 00:47:27,420
Completely.

871
00:47:27,660 --> 00:47:32,980
Under Flyxion's theory of Provenance, control over copying is largely irrelevant to the concept

872
00:47:32,980 --> 00:47:33,600
