00:51:16,960 --> 00:51:18,500
But Flyxion subverts that entirely.

944
00:51:19,280 --> 00:51:23,100
A cryptographic version history is not a fence around a piece of private property.

945
00:51:23,100 --> 00:51:24,620
It is a receipt.

946
00:51:24,760 --> 00:51:25,300
A receipt.

